:Namespace Server
⍝ Serve the functions in api/ as a JSON web API with Jarvis.
⍝ Each api/Name.aplf becomes  POST /Name  (JSON in → APL → JSON out).
⍝
⍝ Started by serve.sh, which runs Dyalog with LOAD=this file: Dyalog then
⍝ calls Server.Run. (A session prints output as it happens; a dyalogscript
⍝ script only prints when it ends, and a server never ends.)
⍝
⍝ Environment: PORT (default 8080).

    ∇ Run;here;port;names;types;j;rc;msg;Env
      ⎕PW←500                                  ⍝ don't wrap log lines at 80 columns
      Env←{2⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment'⍵}
      here←⊃1⎕NPARTS Env'LOAD'                 ⍝ folder of this file
      port←{0=≢⍵:8080 ⋄ ⊃⊃(//⎕VFI ⍵)}Env'PORT'

      {}#.⎕FIX'file://',here,'vendor/Jarvis.dyalog'

      ⍝ Load only the top level of api/ (not api/tests/), so nothing but
      ⍝ the endpoint functions is exposed.
      #.api←#.⎕NS''
      (names types)←0 1(⎕NINFO⍠1)here,'api/*.aplf'
      {}{2 #.api.⎕FIX'file://',⍵}¨names

      j←#.Jarvis.New''
      j.CodeLocation←#.api
      j.Port←port
      ⍝ Run the server loop in this thread: Start blocks and keeps serving.
      j.DYALOG_JARVIS_THREAD←0

      ⎕←''
      ⎕←'Jarvis is serving on port ',(⍕port),'. Endpoints (POST, JSON body):'
      ⎕←↑{'  /',⍵}¨#.api.⎕NL ¯3
      ⎕←'Try:  curl -s -X POST localhost:',(⍕port),'/Primes -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' -d 30'
      ⎕←'Stop: Ctrl+C in this terminal (or `podman stop` the container).'
      ⎕←''
      (rc msg)←j.Start                      ⍝ blocks while serving
      ⎕←'Jarvis stopped: ',⍕rc msg
    ∇
:EndNamespace
